  "referenceNumber": "RUS1478",
  "remarks": "\nMaria Lvova-Belova (henceforth Lvova-Belova) is an involved person under the Russia (Sanctions)(EU Exit) Regulation 2019 because she is responsible for, and provides support for, policies or actions which undermine or threaten the territorial integrity, sovereignty or independence of Ukraine, in her role as the Commissioner for Children’s Rights under the President of the Russian Federation. \n The trust services sanctions were imposed on 21/03/2023.",
